sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant R as Frontend / PrefillRouter
    participant O as Independent Prefill observer
    participant P as Prefill backend / engine
    participant D as Decode backend / engine
    C->>R: Logical generation request
    R->>P: Prefill with selected bootstrap room / DP rank
    Note over R,P: Bootstrap may be known from discovery or first output
    R->>O: Continue consuming Prefill stream
    par Context execution and observation
        P->>P: Compute context KV
        P-->>O: Tail outputs / completion or error
        O->>O: Record observed Prefill completion at stream end
    and Decode coordination and generation
        R->>D: bootstrap_info + Prefill worker / DP rank
        D->>P: Engine-specific receiver / KV coordination
        P-->>D: KV data via connector transport
        D-->>R: Tokens (ordinary items may stream early)
        R-->>C: Streamed tokens
    end
    alt Prefill observer successful
        R-->>C: Permit successful final terminal / EOF
    else Prefill observer failed
        R-->>C: Error (do not emit final success first)
    end
    Note over O,D: Client cancellation does not blindly abort independent Prefill
